defects or inherited metabolic diseases, such as Rett Syndrome, Fragile X Syndrome, Angelman Syndrome, Prader-Willi Syndrome, tuberous sclerosis;\n-  Visual, auditory and physical disabilities;\n-  Complication with other serious chronic diseases, such as liver and kidney failure, connective tissue diseases, tumors.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- Children with Syndromic ASD caused by known genetic defects",\n              "Condition": [\n                "ASD",\n                "genetic defects"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "ASD",\n                "genetic defects"\n              ],\n              "Life-Stage-And-Gender": [\n                "Children"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "Syndromic"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "or inherited metabolic diseases, such as Rett Syndrome,",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "inherited metabolic diseases",\n                    "Rett Syndrome"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "inherited metabolic diseases",\n                    "Rett Syndrome"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "Fragile X Syndrome,",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "Fragile X Syndrome"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "Fragile X Syndrome"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "Angelman Syndrome,",\n                          "Condition