ils.\n- all entities: \'Contraindication\', \'Eq-Value\', \'Severity\', \'Drug\', \'Observation-Name\', \'Age\', \'Location\', \'Organism-Name\', \'Encounter\', \'Drug-Name\', \'Ethnicity\', \'Modifier\', \'Condition\', \'Eq-Unit\', \'Eq-Temporal-Unit\', \'Family-Member\', \'Organism\', \'Other\', \'Immunization-Name\', \'Polarity\', \'Condition-Type\', \'Immunization\', \'Eq-Operator\', \'Eq-Temporal-Recency\', \'Procedure-Name\', \'Indication\', \'Exception\', \'Study\', \'Language\', \'Coreference\', \'Provider\', \'Acuteness\', \'Life-Stage-And-Gender\', \'Procedure\', \'Risk\', \'Death\', \'Assertion\', \'Allergy-Name\', \'Specimen\', \'Negation\', \'Code\', \'Stability\', \'Birth\', \'Criteria-Count\', \'Eq-Comparison\', \'Condition-Name\', \'Insurance\', \'Observation\', \'Allergy\', \'Eq-Temporal-Period\'\n- the lists for the entity\'s should only be appended if one or more entities have been found. Otherwise, omit the arrays completely.\n\n5. The JSON object should be containing the following rules:\n- Ensure that the same logical operator ("AND", "OR", "NOT") does not appear on the same level of the tree structure to maintain the integrity of the logical relationships.\n- Generates JSON files from the textual criteria and organizing them into the described logical structure.\n- Setting the brackets {}, [] and commas, correctly in the JSON is extremely important.\n- Any double quotes within the raw textual criteria are escaped with a backslash (\\").\n- If there are no restrictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  No history or diagnosis of any of the following conditions: Chron\'s disease, bleeding disorders, gastrointestinal or colonic malignancy, Kidney disease, including kidney "stones" or hypercalcemia, Coagulopathy/hereditary hemorrhagic disorders/ or receiving therapeutic doses of Coumadin or heparin.\n-  Ingested certain medications (Calcium, Vitamin D, fiber supplements and Non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drugs - NSAIDs) within 30 days of study start.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- No history or diagnosis of any of the following conditions: Chron\'s disease, bleeding disorders, gastrointestinal",\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "history"\n          ],\n          "Condition": [\n            "Chron\'s disease",\n            "bleeding disorders",\n            "gastrointestinal"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "history"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "Chron\'s disease",\n            "bleeding disorders",\n            "gastrointestinal"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "or colonic malignancy, Kidney disease, including kidney \\"stones\\"",\n              "Condition": [\n                "malignancy",\n                "Kidney disease",\n                "kidney \\"stones\\""\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "malignancy",\n                "Kidney disease",\n                "kidney \\"stones\\""\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "colonic"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "or hypercalcemia, Coagulopathy/",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "hypercalcemia",\n                    "Coagulopathy"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "hypercalcemia",\n                    "Coagulopathy"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "hereditary hemorrhagic disorders/",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "hereditary hemorrhagic disorders"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "hereditary hemorrhagic disorders"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "or receiving therapeutic doses of Coumadin",\n                          "Eq-Comparison": [\n                            "receiving"\n                          ],\n                          "Drug": [\n                            "Coumadin"\n                          ],\n                          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                            "receiving"\n                          ],\n                          "Drug-Name": [\n                            "Coumadin"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "or heparin.",\n                          "Drug": [\n                            "heparin"\n                          ],\n                          "Drug-Name": [\n                            "heparin"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Ingested certain medications (Calcium,",\n          "Drug": [\n            "medications",\n            "Calcium"\n          ],\n          "Drug-Name": [\n            "Calcium"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "Vitamin D,",\n              "Drug": [\n                "Vitamin D"\n              ],\n              "Drug-Name": [\n                "Vitamin D"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "fiber supplements",\n                  "Drug": [\n                    "fiber supplements"\n                  ],\n                  "Drug-Name": [\n                    "fiber supplements"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "and Non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drugs - NSAIDs) within 30 days of study start.",\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "within 30 days"\n                  ],\n                  "Drug": [\n                    "Non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drugs",\n                    "NSAIDs"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "within"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "30"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                    "days"\n                  ],\n                  "Drug-Name": [\n                    "Non-steroidal anti-inflammatory drugs",\n                    "NSAIDs"\n                  ],\n                  "Study": [\n                    "study"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
