an nicotine dependence\n-  Medical conditions that might affect brain function\n-  Current use of medications that could alter brain function\n-  Pregnancy\n-  Current illicit drug use other than occasional use of marijuana\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- History of any Axis I psychiatric diagnosis other than nicotine dependence",\n                      "Eq-Comparison": [\n                        "History"\n                      ],\n                      "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n                        "History"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "psychiatric diagnosis",\n                        "nicotine dependence"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "psychiatric diagnosis",\n                        "nicotine dependence"\n                      ],\n                      "Exception": [\n                        "other than"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Medical conditions that might affect brain function",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "Medical conditions"\n                      ],\n                      "Observation": [\n                        "brain function"\n                      ],\n                      "Observation-Name": [\n                        "brain function"\n                      ],\n                      "Stability": [\n                        "affect"\n                      ],\n                      "Assertion": [\n                        "might"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw