the musculoskeletal system, or dependent of a third person).\n-  Exercise-related dyspnoea or respiratory alterations.\n-  Chronic heart disease with any worsening in the last month.\n-  Adherence rate of less than 80% of the total interventions.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Physical limitations (e.g., restricting injuries of the musculoskeletal system,",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "Physical limitations"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "Physical limitations"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "injuries"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "injuries"\n                  ],\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "musculoskeletal system",\n                    "restricting"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or dependent of a third person).",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "dependent"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "dependent"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Exercise-related dyspnoea",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "dyspnoea"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "dyspnoea"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "Exercise"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "Exercise"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "or respiratory alterations.",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "respiratory alterations"\n                  ],\n                  "Condition-Name": [\n                    "respiratory alterations"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Chronic heart disease with any worsening in the last month.",\n          "Condition": [\n            "heart disease"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "heart disease"\n          ],\n          "Acuteness": [\n            "Chronic"\n          ],\n          "Stability": [\n            "worsening"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "last month"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "last"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "month"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Adherence rate of less than 80% of the total interventions.",\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "80"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "less than 80%"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "less than"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Unit": [\n        "%"\n      ],\n      "Observation": [\n        "Adherence rate"\n      ],\n      "Observation-Name": [\n        "Adherence rate"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
