atology departments from Centre Hospitalier Lyon Sud or Besançon\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "OR": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- reactive arthritis diagnosed in one of the two rheumatology departments from Centre Hospitalier Lyon Sud",\n      "Condition": [\n        "reactive arthritis"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "reactive arthritis"\n      ],\n      "Location": [\n        "Centre Hospitalier Lyon Sud",\n        "rheumatology department"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "or Besançon",\n      "Location": [\n        "Besançon"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
