h kidney tissue to confirm a diagnosis (adequate tissue: more than 2 cores of kidney tissues (10 x 1.2 mm) including over 10-15 glomerulus each)\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- Unwillingness to give informed consent"\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Not enough kidney tissue to confirm a diagnosis (adequate tissue: more than 2 cores of kidney tissue (10 x 1.2 mm) including over 10-15 glomerulus each)",\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "2",\n            "10",\n            "1.2",\n            "15"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "more than"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "more than 2 cores",\n            "10 x 1.2 mm",\n            "over 10-15 glomerulus each"\n          ],\n          "Observation": [\n            "kidney tissues"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "kidney tissue"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "kidney"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Unit": [\n            "cores",\n            "mm",\n            "glomerulus"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
